  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final phase of 10-year supprt to rural development project in Nicaragua. Support to farmers associations and cooepratives (coffee, milk, cattle and womens associations who cultivate theis gardens) through extension services, credits for investments. Support through MAGFOR, ministry for agriculture and forestry. Has resulted in increased incomes amongst farmers.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Slutfas i 10-&#xe5;rig st&#xf6;d till landsbygdsutvecklingsprojekt i Nicaragua. St&#xf6;d . bondekooperativ (kaffe, mj&#xf6;lk, boskap och  kvinnosammanslutningar som odlar sm&#xe5;lotter) i form av utbildning, krediter f&#xf6;r investeringar. Har resulterat i &#xf6;kade inkomster f&#xf6;r b&#xf6;nderna. St&#xf6;d genom MAGFOR, Jordbruk- och skogsbruksministeriet nicaragua.</narrative>
  </description>
